                     <head rend="left">
                        <persName n="bishopmaster" role="stationer enterer">
                           master <surname>bishop</surname>
                        </persName> Receaved of him for printinge <title>
                           <hi rend="italics">A Reformation in Religion</hi>
                        </title>. Alowed vnder the <persName n="londonbishopof">bishop of 
                              <placeName type="pla">london</placeName>
                           
                        </persName> his hand. which treatise is devided into <num>7</num> 
